{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220570","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220570","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322057001:1":{"text":"啊……说了这么多，都忘了向你们正式道歉了。","source_cn":"啊……说了这么多，都忘了向你们正式道歉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0362A842E8279EDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322057002:1":{"text":"这次雪松镇的恐慌，说到底是因为戴蒙和我管教不严才引发的。他随意跑出去，还在半夜叫镇上的孩子们出来玩，我很理解他们父母担忧的心情。","source_cn":"这次雪松镇的恐慌，说到底是因为戴蒙和我管教不严才引发的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9187175C7CE6DBDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322057003:1":{"text":"来吧，戴蒙，向白山公国的各位道个歉。","source_cn":"来吧，戴蒙，向白山公国的各位道个歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6417EBF41AFEAC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322057004:1":{"text":"对不起……大哥哥、大姐姐……我、我做错了。","source_cn":"对不起……大哥哥、大姐姐……我、我做错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9FA0E9EDF62C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322057005:1":{"text":"我也要向你们再次道歉，我上次的行为太冲动。希望你们能体谅一位母亲的心情。","source_cn":"我也要向你们再次道歉，我上次的行为太冲动。希望你们能体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49DD1F84E741F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322057006:0":{"text":"戴蒙，因为这次引起的恐慌，我决定没收你的玩偶傀儡一段时间。","source_cn":"戴蒙，因为这次引起的恐慌，我决定没收你的玩偶傀儡一段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85C28B4A97F682C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322057007:0":{"text":"没有了它，你就没法再带镇上的孩子出来……求求你，这段时间就好好在我们身边休息吧。","source_cn":"没有了它，你就没法再带镇上的孩子出来……求求你，这段时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA17CB8BABD1ED3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322057008:0":{"text":"什么……咳，没收奇奇？妈妈！不要带走奇奇好不好？","source_cn":"什么……咳，没收奇奇？妈妈！不要带走奇奇好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55828A19A60F1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322057009:0":{"text":"我只会没收你的大玩偶傀儡，如果留着大奇奇给你，你就一定还会让它去帮你找镇子里的那些孩子们！但你怀里的小玩偶我不会收走的，你还可以抱着它，就像过去那样。","source_cn":"我只会没收你的大玩偶傀儡，如果留着大奇奇给你，你就一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9B6819E2B710DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322057010:0":{"text":"而且我不会没收太久，过一段时间，我就把它还给你。","source_cn":"而且我不会没收太久，过一段时间，我就把它还给你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164F6FB624F88DEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322057011:0":{"text":"可是、可是……妈妈，求求你……奇奇是我唯一的朋友了！","source_cn":"可是、可是……妈妈，求求你……奇奇是我唯一的朋友了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05613011CF4489E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322057012:0":{"text":"爸爸，求你不要让妈妈带走奇奇……","source_cn":"爸爸，求你不要让妈妈带走奇奇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94803CE748E59F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322057013:0":{"text":"呃，吾爱……？","source_cn":"呃，吾爱……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x096E2B6F61867C21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322057014:0":{"text":"你知道我不会改主意的。","source_cn":"你知道我不会改主意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA74E9F4516056DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322057015:0":{"text":"这是为了你的安全，戴蒙。在事态彻底平息之前，哪里都不要去。听到了吗？","source_cn":"这是为了你的安全，戴蒙。在事态彻底平息之前，哪里都不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DD50BBBB69E388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322057016:0":{"text":"我……我知道了……","source_cn":"我……我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA54B31A3F9F9828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322057017:0":{"text":"呜……！","source_cn":"呜……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA73E62D95A4E1B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1322057018:0":{"text":"戴蒙一边点头，他默默擦着眼泪，钻回了作为临时居所的棺材里","source_cn":"戴蒙一边点头，他默默擦着眼泪，钻回了作为临时居所的棺材里","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD2A3C0B974170D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1322057019:0":{"text":"……戴蒙？他在哭……","source_cn":"……戴蒙？他在哭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x396DE19CEEF8A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322057020:0":{"text":"小孩子很容易情绪化。他落泪的时候，我的心也如刀绞。","source_cn":"小孩子很容易情绪化。他落泪的时候，我的心也如刀绞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x909D939756B94341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322057021:0":{"text":"但是……对不起，我的孩子，原谅妈妈吧。我必须保护你。","source_cn":"但是……对不起，我的孩子，原谅妈妈吧。我必须保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E7DC3D4D874BE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document